&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Pantheon&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pantheon WebOps Platform powers the open web, running more than 300,000 sites in the cloud for customers including Google, Princeton, Salesloft and Doctors Without Borders. Every day, thousands of developers and marketers create, iterate, and scale WordPress and Drupal sites to reach billions of people globally. Pantheon&#39;s multitenant, container-based platform enables organizations to manage all of their websites from a single dashboard. Organizations including Clorox and the United Nations drive results through accelerated development and real-time publishing using Pantheon&#39;s collaborative workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pantheon&#39;s revenue engine runs on a modern go-to-market stack, and we are hiring a GTM Systems Administrator to own the day-to-day administration, automation, integrations, and data quality of the systems our Sales team relies on every day. You will help modernize and consolidate our GTM systems alongside external implementation partners, co-administer our CPQ with Deal Desk, and keep revenue-critical workflows running smoothly at month and quarter end. If you are the person who is equally at home in the HubSpot admin console and a middleware recipe, and you like your work to matter to the number, come build with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Need to Succeed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Administer HubSpot as our CRM platform: objects and data model, pipelines, workflows and automation, permissions, and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
