&lt;p&gt;Pantheon WebOps Platform powers the open web, running more than 300,000 sites in the cloud for customers including Google, Princeton, Salesloft and Doctors Without Borders. Every day, thousands of developers and marketers create, iterate, and scale WordPress and Drupal sites to reach billions of people globally. Pantheon’s multitenant, container-based platform enables organizations to manage all of their websites from a single dashboard. Organizations including Clorox and the United Nations drive results through accelerated development and real-time publishing using Pantheon’s collaborative workflows.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pantheon is transforming the systems that run our business, and our IT &amp;amp; Business Systems team is hiring a Delivery Lead to be its orchestra conductor. This role is deliberately scoped to our own team&#39;s portfolio, it is not a company-wide PMO: you will own the team&#39;s roadmap, orchestrate its largest programs day to day with implementation partners, and run its AI-supported intake process so every stakeholder stays informed. This is a high-visibility role reporting to the VP of IT &amp;amp; Business Systems, with the opportunity to build the delivery rhythm for an AI-first team that moves fast. If you love turning a busy portfolio into a clear plan, and you would rather be in the details than above them, this role is built for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Need to Succeed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
