&lt;li&gt;Build and own the IT &amp;amp; Business Systems team&#39;s portfolio roadmap: planning, sequencing, capacity, and dependency management across the team&#39;s concurrent initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate the team&#39;s largest programs day to day, coordinating external implementation partners, internal systems leads, and business stakeholders against firm deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the team&#39;s AI-supported intake process end to end: verify triage and qualification of incoming requests, route work to the right owner, and keep every requester informed at each step&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate relentlessly: weekly delivery status, launch communications, post-launch reviews, and a published team roadmap that partners across the company can follow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage risks, decisions, and escalations across workstreams; surface slippage early and drive it to resolution with the right owners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate vendors and implementation partners on scope, timelines, and deliverable quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build lightweight, repeatable delivery frameworks (requirements, success metrics, review cadences) for use within the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring to the Table&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7-10 years of delivery management, across IT and business systems at B2B SaaS or high-growth technology companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running at least one major enterprise platform migration or replatform end to end (ERP, CRM, billing, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to run a broad portfolio of initiatives with a small team through ruthless prioritization and clean operating rhythms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written and verbal communication; comfortable presenting to executives and translating between technical and business audiences&lt;/li&gt;
