&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–3 years of Sales Engineering or equivalent customer-facing technical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical curiosity and a continuous learning mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with web infrastructure and modern web platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Domain familiarity with Drupal, WordPress, or Next.js&lt;/li&gt;
